@title Assign parts to all devices never gives a drive a power supply
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
@area Parts
# Hardware test 2026-10-28 finding 4: -T1 (frequency converter) was proposed a 24 V power supply and the dialog only offered Accept all. Now every row has a tick, a part to choose, a match word and a reason.
fresh
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "Frequency converter drive"
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
click_text Place #2
wait 20
key Escape
key ctrl+k
text "Assign parts to all"
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
expect "Assign parts to all devices"
expect "Generic"
expect "Certain"
expect "a frequency converter, as the device is"
expect_not "Phoenix"
shot rows-ticked
click_text "Generic GEN-VFD-7K5"
wait 10
shot part-menu-open
key Escape
wait 5
key Escape
wait 8
expect_not "Assign parts to all devices"
